Third-party code redistributed in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following directory contains a vendored copy of the compiled output and
sources of the Move standard library and the Sui framework, produced by the Move
build system and committed so that the recorder's test programs build and replay
reproducibly:

    test-programs/move/flow_test/build/flow_test/
        bytecode_modules/dependencies/{MoveStdlib,Sui}/
        debug_info/dependencies/{MoveStdlib,Sui}/
        disassembly/dependencies/{MoveStdlib,Sui}/
        sources/dependencies/{MoveStdlib,Sui}/

That tree comprises 1092 files. 182 of them are source files carrying the
upstream copyright headers and an SPDX identifier; the remaining files are
generated build outputs (bytecode, debug info, disassembly) derived from them.

The copyright notices appearing in those headers are:

    Copyright (c) Mysten Labs, Inc.            (182 files)
